&lt;li&gt;IDOR and user authorization weaknesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Session management and authentication mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;File upload security and file management vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security reconnaissance and digital asset discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical vulnerability reporting and remediation recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Among the technical research published under his name is an article examining unauthorized file deletion across separate user sessions due to insufficient ownership validation and access control mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This type of research highlights the importance of enforcing authorization checks on the server side rather than treating file identifiers as proof of ownership or permission.&lt;/p&gt;

